Input: {"question": "Which sports team does Malik Hebbar represent or represent?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 77, "text": "Title: The Unlikely Rise of Malik Hebbar: A Footballer's Journey to FC Istres"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 79, "end": 207, "text": "In the quaint town of Istres, France, nestled between the Mediterranean coast and the Camargue region, a football club was born."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 208, "end": 378, "text": "FC Istres, founded in 1920, had been a staple of the local community for generations, fostering a passion for the beautiful game that resonated deeply with its residents."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 379, "end": 597, "text": "Among the many talented players who donned the club's iconic blue and white jersey was a young man named Malik Hebbar, whose journey to FC Istres was a testament to perseverance, dedication, and a dash of good fortune."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 598, "end": 773, "text": "Malik's love affair with football began on the dusty streets of his childhood neighborhood, where he would spend hours kicking a makeshift ball made of plastic bags and twine."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 774, "end": 911, "text": "As he grew older, his natural talent and enthusiasm caught the attention of local coaches, who recognized the potential in the young boy."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 912, "end": 1073, "text": "Malik's parents, though initially hesitant, soon became his biggest supporters, sacrificing precious time and resources to nurture their son's burgeoning career."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1074, "end": 1219, "text": "Years of hard work and sacrifice paid off when Malik earned a spot in a prestigious youth academy in Marseille, just a stone's throw from Istres."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1220, "end": 1351, "text": "It was here that he honed his skills, learning from experienced coaches and competing against the best young players in the region."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1352, "end": 1483, "text": "Malik's impressive performances did not go unnoticed, and soon he was being scouted by several clubs in the French lower divisions."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1484, "end": 1593, "text": "One fateful day, Malik received an offer from FC Istres, a club that had been following his progress closely."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1594, "end": 1705, "text": "The opportunity to play for a team with such a rich history and passionate fan base was too enticing to resist."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1706, "end": 1840, "text": "After careful consideration, Malik made the decision to join FC Istres, a move that would change the trajectory of his career forever."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1841, "end": 1904, "text": "The evidence of Malik's affiliation with FC Istres is abundant."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1905, "end": 2048, "text": "A simple glance at the club's official website reveals Malik's name on the team roster, alongside his position, date of birth, and nationality."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2049, "end": 2255, "text": "Furthermore, a cursory search of local newspapers and sports websites yields numerous articles and match reports featuring Malik's name, highlighting his contributions to the team's successes and struggles."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2256, "end": 2449, "text": "One such article, published in the regional newspaper La Provence, details Malik's impressive debut for FC Istres, in which he scored a crucial goal in a 2-1 victory over rival club, AS Cannes."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 12, "text": "Malik Hebbar"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 14, "end": 95, "text": "Malik Hebbar is an Italian professional footballer who currently plays for S.S.D."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 96, "end": 177, "text": "Pro Sesto Calcio, an Italian football club based in Sesto San Giovanni, Lombardy."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 178, "end": 199, "text": "Early Life and Career"}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 201, "end": 261, "text": "Malik Hebbar was born on February 12, 1995, in Milan, Italy."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 262, "end": 295, "text": "He began his youth career at A.C."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 296, "end": 367, "text": "Milan's youth academy, where he spent five years developing his skills."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 368, "end": 490, "text": "In 2012, he moved to Inter Milan's youth academy, where he played for two seasons before being promoted to the first team."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 491, "end": 510, "text": "Professional Career"}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 512, "end": 621, "text": "Hebbar made his professional debut for Inter Milan on August 31, 2014, in a Serie A match against Torino F.C."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 622, "end": 733, "text": "He played for Inter Milan's first team for three seasons, making a total of 25 appearances and scoring 5 goals."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 734, "end": 771, "text": "In 2017, Hebbar transferred to S.S.D."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 772, "end": 842, "text": "Pro Sesto Calcio, where he has since become a key player for the team."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 843, "end": 957, "text": "During the 2018-2019 season, he scored 12 goals in 30 appearances, helping the team secure a promotion to Serie C."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 959, "end": 981, "text": "Studies and References"}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 983, "end": 1121, "text": "A study published in the Journal of Sports Science and Medicine in 2019 analyzed the performance of Hebbar during his time at Inter Milan."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1122, "end": 1270, "text": "The study found that Hebbar's speed and agility were significantly higher than the average Serie A player, making him an effective attacking threat."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1271, "end": 1274, "text": "[1]"}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1276, "end": 1399, "text": "In an interview with Italian sports newspaper La Gazzetta dello Sport in 2020, Hebbar discussed his decision to join S.S.D."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1400, "end": 1507, "text": "Pro Sesto Calcio, stating that he was attracted to the team's \"ambitious project\" and \"strong team spirit.\""}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1508, "end": 1511, "text": "[2]"}, "D2S22": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1513, "end": 1704, "text": "A report by Italian football website TuttoMercatoWeb in 2020 listed Hebbar as one of the top 10 players in Serie C, citing his \"exceptional dribbling skills\" and \"clinical finishing ability.\""}}, "candidates": [], "original_cards": [], "initial_answers": ["FC Istres", "S.S.D. Pro Sesto Calcio"]}
